    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"snapshot.\" it's everything. my career, my friends, my family... they all saw the same thing. the way people look at me when they realize who i am? it's like they're looking through me. i feel like i'm just waiting for the world to catch up to the fact that i don't belong here anymore. there's no rebuilding from this. there's just the shame.",
