    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a \"new chapter\" though. you can't start a new book when the old one has been burned to the ground. there's no \"focusing on what i have\" when everything i had was based on a person who doesn't exist anymore. i just feel like i'm dragging this heavy, broken thing around, pretending i'm still part of society, but i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. it would be so much easier if i could just... stop pretending. if the version of me they hate was actually gone, maybe things would finally be quiet.",
